    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mama Station</i> is a casual simulation game themed around a courier station. Players must manage a bustling courier station by rationally allocating resources, constructing and managing facilities, and building an efficiently operating delivery hub amidst mountains of packages. Featuring no heroic, world-saving plot \u2013 just extraordinary days in an ordinary job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different packages randomly trigger various effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slightly advanced delivery facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire diverse types of employees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous devices and facilities added to boost income</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen upgradeable skills for efficient management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen unique customer designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ purchasable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of decorative facilities to build and customize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable wallpapers and flooring</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mama Station</i> is a casual simulation game themed around a courier station. Players must manage a bustling courier station by rationally allocating resources, constructing and managing facilities, and building an efficiently operating delivery hub amidst mountains of packages. Featuring no heroic, world-saving plot \u2013 just extraordinary days in an ordinary job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different packages randomly trigger various effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slightly advanced delivery facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire diverse types of employees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous devices and facilities added to boost income</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen upgradeable skills for efficient management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen unique customer designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ purchasable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of decorative facilities to build and customize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable wallpapers and flooring</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u300aMama Station\u300bis a casual simulation game where players manage a busy package hub. Through smart resource allocation and facility development, you'll transform the chaotic package flow into a streamlined logistics center.",
